    the @fontsource-variable/cairo npm package. The files are not stored in
    this repository.

BRAND MARKS

  Fasla and Smicolon names and logos
    apps/docs/public/brand/*, packages/fasla-ui/registry/ui/fasla-logo/,
    favicon.ico, smicolon-icon.png, Logo-dark.svg, Logo-light.svg.
    Owned by Smicolon GmbH.

  Platform marks in Social Icons
    packages/fasla-ui/registry/ui/social-icons/ draws the marks of 32
    platforms (Apple, Google, GitHub, Slack, Zoom and others). Each mark is a
    trademark of its owner and is shown only to link to that platform.

IMAGES

  Wall of Love testimonials
    apps/docs/public/landing/img/wall/*: one photo and 13 company logos,
    copied from the testimonials smicolon.com publishes.

  Landing film
    apps/docs/public/landing/media/*: the Fasla product film and its posters,
    in English and Arabic.

